  "withoutDain": {
    "briefing": "Dain is dead, but Lark’s living branch carries the workers’ memories and the ledger records their last orders. Tamsin, an adept from the villages, has joined the escort to help bring that evidence to the council. The Rootbinder bars the river to protect his supply of bodies. Capture the bridge fort and bring Lark to the northern meeting alive.",
